{
  "id": 317992720,
  "iid": 16656,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "nettrace_3gpp_32_423: Eliminate unnecessary copies of RE matches.",
  "description": "In nettrace_parse_address, there is no need to copy the matched parts of the\nregular expression into separate buffers; g_match_info_fetch_named already\nprovides a NUL-terminated allocated buffer containing just the match.\n\nWhile we're here, stop leaking those strings returned by\ng_match_info_fetch_named.  Also, insert a temporary NUL-terminator at the end\nof the string we are passing into g_regex_match so that it will stop at the\nexpected location.\n\nFix #19940",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2024-07-29T10:44:00.281Z",
  "updated_at": "2024-08-26T07:29:28.771Z",
